{"lines": ["December ninth, 1965. A fireball burns across six states and Canada. Seismographs feel it.", "In Kecksburg, Pennsylvania, people see blue smoke, feel a thump, and say something crashed in the woods.", "Police rope off the area. Soldiers search with Geiger counters.", "Locals later describe an acorn-shaped object, Volkswagen-sized, with hieroglyph-like symbols, hauled away on a flatbed.", "The official answer: they found nothing. A meteor.", "In 2005, NASA said fragments from the area came from a Soviet satellite. The records? Lost in the nineteen eighties.", "But here's the twist. NASA's own catalogue says the fireball's path was too steep for any satellite. Likely a meteor.", "So NASA has told two stories. One has missing files.", "Meteor, satellite, or something taken away in the dark? Tell me below."], "words": [["December", 0.0, 0.22], ["ninth,", 0.22, 0.84], ["1965.", 1.82, 1.86], ["A", 2.68, 2.8], ["fireball", 2.8, 3.16], ["burns", 3.16, 3.6], ["across", 3.6, 3.98], ["six", 3.98, 4.32], ["states", 4.32, 4.64], ["and", 4.64, 4.92], ["Canada.", 4.92, 5.28], ["Seismographs", 5.7, 6.42], ["feel", 6.42, 6.68], ["it.", 6.68, 6.92], ["In", 7.42, 7.5], ["Kecksburg,", 7.5, 7.96], ["Pennsylvania,", 8.16, 8.56], ["people", 9.16, 9.32], ["see", 9.32, 9.66], ["blue", 9.66, 9.86], ["smoke,", 9.86, 10.22], ["feel", 10.22, 10.6], ["a", 10.6, 10.76], ["thump,", 10.76, 11.04], ["and", 11.04, 11.34], ["say", 11.34, 11.52], ["something", 11.52, 11.9], ["crashed", 11.9, 12.18], ["in", 12.18, 12.5], ["the", 12.5, 12.6], ["woods.", 12.6, 12.84], ["Police", 13.437, 13.62], ["rope", 13.62, 13.96], ["off", 13.96, 14.3], ["the", 14.3, 14.46], ["area.", 14.46, 14.72], ["Soldiers", 15.14, 15.58], ["search", 15.58, 15.88], ["with", 15.88, 16.16], ["Geiger", 16.16, 16.62], ["counters.", 16.62, 16.94], ["Locals", 17.741, 18.06], ["later", 18.06, 18.3], ["describe", 18.3, 18.78], ["an", 18.78, 19.1], ["acorn-shaped", 19.1, 19.76], ["object,", 19.76, 20.3], ["Volkswagen-sized,", 20